  <ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock id="Tag169" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;1) None&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2) On January 2, 2025, Plains Oryx Permian Basin Pipeline LLC acquired 100% of Medallion Midstream Services, LLC, which included MDE Midstream, LLC, from the Energy &amp;amp; Minerals Group Fund IV, LP, and EMG Fund IV Offshore Holdings, LP for an aggregate purchase price of $161 million, plus purchase price adjustments of approximately $2 million.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3) None&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;4) None&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5) None&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfImportantNotesRegardingFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="Tag170" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;On January 2, 2025, Plains Oryx Permian Basin Pipeline LLC acquired 100% of Medallion Midstream Services, LLC, which included MDE Midstream, LLC, from the Energy &amp;amp; Minerals Group Fund IV, LP, and EMG Fund IV Offshore Holdings, LP for an aggregate purchase price of $161 million, plus purchase price adjustments of approximately $2 million.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfImportantNotesRegardingFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
